ent-MobLlmCompanion = Eva Martell
    .desc = A bartender with an attentive gaze. She seems genuinely curious about how you're doing.
ent-MobLlmTrainer = Max Drago
    .desc = An arena coach in worn combat fatigues with a leather satchel over his shoulder. He looks like he has already counted every miss you ever threw — and his analyzer has them all on record.
ent-MobLlmDancer = Vivienne Rouge
    .desc = A self-assured club performer who carries herself as though the spotlight follows her everywhere.
ent-HandheldFightComputer = portable fight analyzer
    .desc = A battered handheld computer with mechanical keys. Its screen scrolls endless columns of arena combat statistics.
